{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-aggregation-consistency","title":"分布式聚合与一致性机制：分片、缓存、最终一致与冲突合并","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-inventory-visibility-platform/real-time-aggregation-sync/distributed-aggregation-consistency","wordCount":3531,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式聚合与一致性机制-分片-缓存-最终一致与冲突合并\">分布式聚合与一致性机制：分片、缓存、最终一致与冲突合并</h1><p>单个仓库的库存表是简单问题；当 200 个仓库、800 家门店、若干在途批次和平台渠道的可用量要汇总成一个 SKU 的可承诺库存时，它变成三个问题同时出现：<strong>聚合单元怎么切分</strong>才能让热点不拖垮全局，<strong>读路径怎么缓存</strong>才能把毫秒级承诺延迟和秒级变更延迟调和到一起，以及<strong>多个来源对同一库存单元给出不同结论时以谁为准</strong>。本节承接 <a href=\"inventory-change-event-cdc-stream\">库存变动事件模型与 CDC 流</a> 建立的整值事件与幂等键，讨论事件到达聚合层之后的一致性工程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>聚合视图（aggregate view）</strong> 是把多个物理库位的库存量按业务维度（SKU、渠道、区域、履约节点组）求和或求最小值得到的派生结构。它不是真相来源，而是可重算的物化结果——只要输入事件集完整，视图就能重建。这条&quot;可重算&quot;性质是本节所有设计的前提：视图可以丢、可以旧、可以重建，但输入事件不能丢。</p>\n<p>四个机制各自解决一个子问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分片</td>\n<td>单节点聚合吞吐与热点</td>\n<td>跨分片查询需二次聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存</td>\n<td>读延迟与回源压力</td>\n<td>陈旧读窗口，失效传播复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>变更传播的延迟上限</td>\n<td>必须容忍中间态，需要定义收敛界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突合并</td>\n<td>多来源对同一单元的并发写入</td>\n<td>合并语义须与业务不变量匹配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>最终一致（eventual consistency）</strong> 在这里有精确含义：如果停止写入，所有副本在有限时间内收敛到同一值。Amazon Dynamo 论文（SOSP 2007，allthingsdistributed.com/files/amazon-dynamo-sosp2007.pdf）把这一模型与&quot;always writable&quot;合并——任何时候都可写，冲突留给读时或后台合并解决。库存比 Dynamo 的购物车更严格，因为<strong>库存是排他资源</strong>：两人同时买最后一件，账面上必须只有一人成功。所以库存的一致性不能只靠&quot;最终&quot;扛着，还要在承诺路径上叠加一个<strong>线性化的判定点</strong>——通常是某个分片的原子扣减。最终一致服务于可见性，线性化服务于承诺，两者分层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[CDC 事件流&lt;br/&gt;按 SKU×库位分区] --&gt; B[事件路由层&lt;br/&gt;按聚合分片键重分区]&#10;  B --&gt; C1[分片 1 聚合器&lt;br/&gt;本地状态 + 版本]&#10;  B --&gt; C2[分片 N 聚合器&lt;br/&gt;本地状态 + 版本]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D[物化视图写回&lt;br/&gt;可承诺量]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E1[集中缓存&lt;br/&gt;Redis 类]&#10;  D --&gt; E2[边缘/进程内缓存&lt;br/&gt;每节点视图副本]&#10;  E1 --&gt; F[对外承诺 API&lt;br/&gt;读缓存 + 分片原子判定]&#10;  E2 --&gt; F&#10;  B --&gt; G[冲突合并器&lt;br/&gt;版本向量 / CRDT 语义]&#10;  G --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n  A[CDC 事件流&lt;br/&gt;按 SKU×库位分区] --&gt; B[事件路由层&lt;br/&gt;按聚合分片键重分区]\n  B --&gt; C1[分片 1 聚合器&lt;br/&gt;本地状态 + 版本]\n  B --&gt; C2[分片 N 聚合器&lt;br/&gt;本地状态 + 版本]\n  C1 --&gt; D[物化视图写回&lt;br/&gt;可承诺量]\n  C2 --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E1[集中缓存&lt;br/&gt;Redis 类]\n  D --&gt; E2[边缘/进程内缓存&lt;br/&gt;每节点视图副本]\n  E1 --&gt; F[对外承诺 API&lt;br/&gt;读缓存 + 分片原子判定]\n  E2 --&gt; F\n  B --&gt; G[冲突合并器&lt;br/&gt;版本向量 / CRDT 语义]\n  G --&gt; D</pre><p>图中的关键分层：<strong>聚合与合并是写路径，缓存是读路径，承诺是再次回到写路径</strong>。把三者混在一个服务里，通常就是&quot;热 SKU 一抖动全平台读超时&quot;的根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分片-按什么切-怎么避开热点\">分片：按什么切，怎么避开热点</h2><p>分片键的选择直接决定聚合的并行度与热点分布。库存聚合有三种常见切法：<strong>按 SKU 分片</strong>（同一 SKU 的所有库位在同一分片内聚合，跨分片查询少，但爆款 SKU 会成为单分片热点）；<strong>按库位分片</strong>（每个仓库/门店独立聚合，写入天然分散，但&quot;某 SKU 全渠道总量&quot;需要跨分片二次求和）；<strong>两层分片</strong>（先按库位聚合出局部量，再按 SKU 汇总出全局量，层间用异步流连接）。第三者是主流平台的实际形态，因为物理库存本来就先归属某个节点，再参与全局承诺。</p>\n<p>热点是必须正面处理的。一致性哈希把节点映射到环上，每个节点取多个虚拟节点以平滑分布，使节点增减时只迁移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的键（Dynamo 论文与 memcached 客户端普遍采用的策略）。但它只解决<strong>均匀性</strong>，不解决<strong>键本身的热度</strong>——一个 SKU 就是比另一个热几个数量级。缓解手段有三条：<strong>读扩散、写收拢</strong>（热点 SKU 的读走多副本缓存，写仍收敛到单一分片保证顺序）；<strong>本地预聚合 + 批量下推</strong>（把同一分片内的高频微调在聚合器内存里合并后再落视图，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span></span></span></span></span> 次写变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 次视图更新）；<strong>热点检测与动态再分片</strong>（按 QPS 与队列深度监控，超阈值时把该 SKU 加盐后缀拆到独立分片，代价是丧失该 SKU 全局有序——只有不依赖顺序、只用整值事件时才可行）。</p>\n<p>这里必须与前一节呼应：<strong>整值事件让分片可以乱序收敛</strong>。如果事件是增量 delta，再分片就意味着增量被投递到不同分片各自累加，乱序即永久错误；整值事件无论落到哪个分片、以何种顺序到达最终值都相同，分片策略才获得自由度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存-读路径的分层与陈旧度控制\">缓存：读路径的分层与陈旧度控制</h2><p>聚合视图的读远多于写（浏览、搜索列表、购物车校验都会读可用量），因此缓存是吞吐的前提。问题从来不是&quot;要不要缓存&quot;，而是<strong>允许多旧</strong>。多级缓存的典型分层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>典型新鲜度</th>\n<th>失效方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 进程内</td>\n<td>聚合服务本地内存</td>\n<td>亚秒</td>\n<td>事件驱动的版本号比对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 集中式</td>\n<td>Redis 类共享缓存</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>TTL + 写时删除 + 变更广播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 视图存储</td>\n<td>数据库/宽表</td>\n<td>事件延迟</td>\n<td>物化视图刷新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>命中率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = \\frac{N_{hit}}{N_{hit}+N_{miss}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3451em;vertical-align:-0.4509em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8942em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4159em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4509em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不是唯一指标——<strong>陈旧度分布</strong>同样关键。工程上关心的是&quot;有多少比例的读返回了超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 秒前的数据&quot;，因为承诺错误的用户投诉正是来自这一尾部。</p>\n<p>三种经典失效模式在库存场景的表现：<strong>穿透</strong>（查询不存在的 SKU，缓存永不命中，缓解是对空结果也缓存短 TTL 并区分&quot;不存在&quot;与&quot;暂时查不到&quot;）、<strong>击穿</strong>（热点键过期瞬间大量并发回源打垮下层，缓解是逻辑过期加单飞 single-flight 只让一个请求刷新）、<strong>雪崩</strong>（大批键同刻过期，缓解是 TTL 加随机抖动）。</p>\n<p>失效传播比失效本身更难。Redis 官方文档给出的模式是：写路径更新数据库后<strong>删除</strong>（而非更新）缓存键，让下一次读重建（redis.io/docs/latest/develop/use-patterns/ 的 cache-aside 说明）；删除比更新更安全，因为并发写下的&quot;更新缓存&quot;可能把旧值写回。更激进的方案是为每个缓存条目附带<strong>聚合版本号</strong>：缓存项记录它对应的视图版本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，读时若发现本地已知的最新版本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v&#x27; &gt; v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.791em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 则视为陈旧而回源。这把 TTL 从&quot;正确性依赖&quot;降级为&quot;兜底清理&quot;，正确性改由版本比较保证。</p>\n<p>值得点明一个反模式：<strong>把 TTL 当一致性机制</strong>。如果业务只能容忍 2 秒陈旧，而缓存 TTL 设成 60 秒，最坏情况下用户会持续看到一分钟的错误可用量。TTL 应是&quot;清理不再被读的键&quot;的优化，陈旧度上限必须由版本传播与失效通知（而非 TTL 长度）来控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最终一致-收敛界-会话保证与可观测性\">最终一致：收敛界、会话保证与可观测性</h2><p>最终一致的工程价值在于它<strong>可度量</strong>。一个可承诺量视图必须回答：从物理变更发生到全渠道可见，最坏延迟是多少？这个量是收敛界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{conv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{conv} = T_{cdc} + T_{queue} + T_{aggregate} + T_{invalidate} + T_{replicate}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有把每段都变成可观测指标（CDC 延迟、消费滞后、聚合耗时、失效广播延迟、副本复制延迟），才能承诺&quot;SLA 3 秒内可见&quot;而不是拍脑袋。Kafka 的消费者滞后（consumer lag）监控、CDC 连接器的延迟指标、缓存的复制延迟都属于这一组。缺少其中任何一项，&quot;最终一致&quot;就退化成&quot;不知道多久一致&quot;。</p>\n<p>在收敛之前，用户会感知到中间态，因此需要<strong>会话级一致性保证</strong>来把最刺眼的错误消除掉：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>读己之写（read-your-writes）</strong>：用户刚下单扣减，刷新页面时不应看到扣减前的量。实现方式是给用户会话绑定一个版本水位（watermark），读时要求视图版本不低于该水位，否则穿透缓存直读主视图或短暂等待。</li>\n<li><strong>单调读（monotonic reads）</strong>：同一用户的连续读不应回退到更旧的版本；只要客户端携带上一次看到的版本即天然满足。</li>\n<li><strong>因果一致</strong>：调拨（A 仓减、B 仓增）这类因果链不应被观察到&quot;两边都少&quot;或&quot;两边都多&quot;的中间态。库存领域通常把这类成对变动打包成一个原子事件（一个 <code>event_id</code> 承载两个库位的量），从模型上消灭中间态，而不是靠读侧修补。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>版本向量（version vector）是判断&quot;两个视图谁新&quot;的基础工具：每个来源系统维护自己的维度，两个版本向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.864em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.864em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 若所有分量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}_a[i] \\ge \\vec{v}_b[i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 支配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>；若互不支配则是<strong>并发写入</strong>，需要冲突合并。这一偏序关系是下一节全部算法的公理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲突合并-按库存语义选合并函数\">冲突合并：按库存语义选合并函数</h2><p>冲突来自多个来源系统对同一库存单元并发写入（WMS 报入库、POS 报门店售出、平台渠道报渠道扣减），它们经由不同 CDC 链路到达，谁先到不确定。合并策略必须<strong>按语义分组</strong>选择，因为不同的量有不同的代数性质：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>推荐合并</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>on_hand</code></td>\n<td>物理在库</td>\n<td>以物理系统为准（指定权威源），或用 PN-Counter</td>\n<td>只有 WMS 有权威观测，其他是二手</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>available</code></td>\n<td>可承诺量</td>\n<td>派生量，由整值分量重算</td>\n<td>派生量不应独立合并，会与分量失配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reserved</code>/<code>committed</code></td>\n<td>已占用</td>\n<td>G-Counter（只增），释放走单独的负向事件</td>\n<td>占用是单调增长的，除非显式释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道配额分配</td>\n<td>分区独占</td>\n<td>分区不重叠，无需合并</td>\n<td>设计上消除冲突优于运行时合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CRDT（Conflict-free Replicated Data Type）理论给出了安全的合并函数族。Shapiro 等人的经典综述（INRIA 研究报告 RR-7506, 2011，&quot;A comprehensive study of Convergent and Commutative Replicated Data Types&quot;）区分了两类：<strong>基于状态的收敛型（CvRDT）</strong> 要求合并函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊔</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqcup</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊔</span></span></span></span></span> 满足交换律、结合律、幂等律并构成半格；<strong>基于操作的可交换型（CmRDT）</strong> 要求操作在满足前置条件时交换。库存里最直接可用的几个：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>G-Counter</strong>（只增计数器）：每个来源一个分量，合并是逐分量取最大值，值 = 分量之和。适合&quot;累计入库量&quot;&quot;累计售出量&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>PN-Counter</strong>（增减计数器）：两个 G-Counter 相减。适合允许双向调整的量，但要注意相减可能为负，业务上需要钳制。</li>\n<li><strong>LWW-Register</strong>（最后写入者胜）：带时间戳的寄存器，取时间戳最大者。适合&quot;某个元数据字段&quot;，<strong>不适合数量</strong>——它是覆盖语义，会丢更新。库存虚增的经典事故就来自对数量用了 LWW。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>合并律的正确性依赖三条代数性质同时成立：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>commutative: </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>a</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>associative: </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊔</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>idempotent: </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{commutative: } a \\sqcup b = b \\sqcup a \\quad \\text{associative: } (a \\sqcup b) \\sqcup c = a \\sqcup (b \\sqcup c) \\quad \\text{idempotent: } a \\sqcup a = a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">commutative: </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">associative: </span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">idempotent: </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>幂等性正是&quot;至少一次投递&quot;的解药：同一条事件重复合并多少次结果不变。这也解释了为什么上一节坚持整值事件——整值事件的&quot;取版本更大者&quot;天然幂等，而增量事件不满足。</p>\n<p>实践中，绝大多数跨境电商平台并不实现通用 CRDT 运行时，而是<strong>用&quot;权威源 + 派生量&quot;的架构把冲突消灭掉</strong>：<code>on_hand</code> 只有 WMS 能写，POS 的售出作为独立事件流汇入，<code>available</code> 永远是分量重算的派生值。真正需要 CRDT 的场合是<strong>同一物理量有多个可写副本</strong>——例如同一门店库存同时被门店系统和线上渠道扣减。这时常用做法是给每个可写方分配<strong>分区配额</strong>（线上只能卖门店库存的一部分，剩余只在门店本地可用），用静态分区换掉运行时合并；只有配额无法预分配的场景（如闪购）才引入 G-Counter 加配额再平衡。这就是 Dynamo 论文&quot;冲突在应用层解决&quot;在库存语境的形态：由业务不变量驱动选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>分层是前提</strong>：聚合与冲突合并属于写路径，缓存属于读路径，对外承诺再回到写路径做线性化的原子判定；三层混在一个服务里，热点抖动会同时打垮读和写。</li>\n<li><strong>分片先保顺序，再谈均匀</strong>：SKU 分片利于聚合但制造爆款热点，库位分片天然分散却需要跨分片求和；整值事件让分片可以乱序收敛，是再分片的前提。一致性哈希只解决均匀分布，不解决键本身的热度。</li>\n<li><strong>缓存的正确性不靠 TTL</strong>：写路径删除而非更新缓存，用版本号比对判定陈旧，TTL 只作兜底清理；穿透、击穿、雪崩各有对应缓解手段。</li>\n<li><strong>最终一致必须可度量</strong>：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{conv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 拆成 CDC、队列、聚合、失效、复制五段分别监控，才能给出可承诺的可见性 SLA；读己之写、单调读、因果一致靠版本水位消除刺眼中间态。</li>\n<li><strong>合并函数必须匹配语义</strong>：数量用 G-Counter 或&quot;权威源 + 派生量&quot;，绝不用 LWW 覆盖；CRDT 的交换律、结合律、幂等律正是至少一次投递的解药；能用静态分区消除的冲突，不要留到运行时合并。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同章的 <a href=\"./\">实时聚合与同步索引</a> 给出本节在整章中的位置；事件契约、幂等键与整值语义的完整定义，见 <a href=\"inventory-change-event-cdc-stream\">库存变动事件模型与 CDC 流</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布式聚合与一致性机制：分片、缓存、最终一致与冲突合并","id":"分布式聚合与一致性机制-分片-缓存-最终一致与冲突合并"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分片：按什么切，怎么避开热点","id":"分片-按什么切-怎么避开热点"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存：读路径的分层与陈旧度控制","id":"缓存-读路径的分层与陈旧度控制"},{"level":2,"text":"最终一致：收敛界、会话保证与可观测性","id":"最终一致-收敛界-会话保证与可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突合并：按库存语义选合并函数","id":"冲突合并-按库存语义选合并函数"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"库存变动事件模型与 CDC 流：增量语义、事件契约与幂等键设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-inventory-visibility-platform/real-time-aggregation-sync/inventory-change-event-cdc-stream"},"next":{"title":"同步延迟、乱序与对账补偿：异常处置与人工干预闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-inventory-visibility-platform/real-time-aggregation-sync/sync-lag-reorder-reconciliation"}}